/* 상점 화면 — 카테고리 탭 + 그룹별 상품 목록. 부품·색·글자는 Theme.uss 를 따른다. */

.tab {
	font-size: 36px;
}

.shop-list {
	flex-grow: 1;
}

.shop-group-title {
	margin: 18px 0 12px 6px;
	font-size: 48px;
	color: var(--gold);
	-unity-text-outline-width: 2px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: var(--ink);
	text-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ink);
}

/* 낱개 상품 3열 */
.shop-grid {
	flex-direction: row;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	justify-content: flex-start;
}

/* ── 상품 칸 공통 ───────────────────────────────── */

.shop-card {
	padding: 20px;
	margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.shop-card__title {
	font-size: 36px;
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
	white-space: normal;
}

.shop-card__limit {
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--ink-sub);
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
}

.shop-card__buy {
	min-width: 0;
	height: 96px;
	padding: 0 16px 8px 16px;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
}

.shop-card__price-icon {
	width: 48px;
	height: 48px;
	margin-right: 8px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card__price {
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--white);
	-unity-text-outline-width: 1px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: var(--ink);
	text-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--ink);
}

/* ── 낱개 (3열 그리드) ─────────────────────────── */

.shop-card--single {
	width: 31.5%;
	margin-right: 1.5%;
	align-items: stretch;
}

.shop-card__media {
	height: 200px;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	margin: 8px 0;
}

.shop-card__currency {
	width: 180px;
	height: 180px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card__item {
	width: 180px;
	height: 180px;
}

.shop-card__amount {
	font-size: 48px;
	color: var(--gold);
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 2px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: var(--ink);
	text-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ink);
}

/* 보너스 — 칸 오른쪽 위 모서리 밖으로 걸쳐 이름을 가리지 않는다 */
.shop-card__bonus {
	position: absolute;
	top: -18px;
	right: -10px;
}

.shop-card--single {
	margin-top: 14px;
}

/* ── 넓은 칸 (상자·패키지·패스·광고 제거) ──────── */

.shop-card__row {
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
}

.shop-card__icon-frame {
	width: 200px;
	height: 200px;
	padding: 18px;
	margin-right: 24px;
	background-image: url("../../Pixel/slot_gold.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 6;
	-unity-slice-right: 6;
	-unity-slice-top: 6;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 6;
	-unity-slice-scale: 4px;
}

.shop-card__text {
	flex-grow: 1;
	flex-shrink: 1;
	align-items: flex-start;
}

.shop-card--wide .shop-card__title {
	font-size: 48px;
	-unity-text-align: middle-left;
	margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.shop-card--wide .shop-card__limit {
	-unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

.shop-card__desc {
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--ink-sub);
	white-space: normal;
	margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.shop-card__package {
	flex-direction: row;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	margin: 12px 0;
}

.shop-card__package .item-cell {
	width: 160px;
	height: 160px;
	margin: 6px;
}

.shop-card__buttons {
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: flex-end;
	margin-top: 14px;
}

.shop-card__buttons .btn {
	margin-left: 12px;
}

.shop-card--wide .shop-card__buy {
	min-width: 260px;
}

/* 자동분해 체크 */
.shop-card__check {
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	margin-right: auto;
	padding: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--text);
}

.shop-card__check-box {
	width: 48px;
	height: 48px;
	margin-right: 10px;
	background-image: url("../../Pixel/slot_empty.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 6;
	-unity-slice-right: 6;
	-unity-slice-top: 6;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 6;
	-unity-slice-scale: 2px;
}

.shop-card__check-box--on {
	background-image: url("../../Pixel/slot_gold.png");
	background-color: var(--green);
}
